ages/parcels" target="_blank" rel="noopener">NC OneMap</a> · <a href="https://vgin.vdem.virginia.gov/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Virginia VGIN</a>. Bounded live queries, not a complete local inventory. Parcel dates and acreage basis appear in the inspector.<div id="map-status" class="mapstatus" role="status"></div></div></section><div id="inspector">${inspect()}</div>`
